# bookworm-security mirror still serves deb12u1 .137 and the .169 package is
# not yet available from the official security package pool. The image build
# refreshes apt metadata on every workflow run, so it will pick up .169 as soon
# as Debian publishes it. Added 2026-08-23. REMOVE these entries after
